chromite: credits

Chromite is a new game after Chromium B.S.U. (2000) by Mark B. Allan: its
rules, enemy behaviours and wave scripts are re-implemented from that game's
source (Clarified Artistic License), and its craft are modelled after that
game's art. No code, image or sound of the original is included.

Everything in this game is made by its own code (models in models.c,
textures and the reflected environment in textures.c, the fortress in
world.c, sound and music by tools/make-audio.mjs), except the fonts:

